ranch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1800425 - Support text/uri-list for file drag&drop. r=stransky, a=RyanVM", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsDragService.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2b365c2e03ca01b47a525a7cedd9aafa52f1bb90", "parents": ["3030174deecd5c3dfc5f2839aea351934742c697"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1805269 - Don't allow getting gamepad and VR test services outside of automation. r=smaug,cmartin a=RyanVM\n\nThese interfaces are already disabled by prefs, but they are ironically\nprobably not well tested, so just add an extra check.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D164496", "files": ["dom/base/Navigator.cpp", "dom/base/Navigator.h", "dom/webidl/Navigator.webidl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "906c5b4774c2eca4fcd86d32ac84c0c8339a9081", "parents": ["2b365c2e03ca01b47a525a7cedd9aafa52f1bb90"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Greg Tatum \u003ctatum.creative@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1802690 - Re-work error handling DocumentL10n::TranslateDocument; r=nordzilla, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D163264", "files": ["dom/l10n/DocumentL10n.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "286ae152fb854695d9eb93ffd1a97f01285a885d", "parents": ["906c5b4774c2eca4fcd86d32ac84c0c8339a9081"], "tags": []}], "date": 1671465441, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "140": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Halberstadt \u003cahal@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1805194 - [ci] Migrate tasks from AWS -\u003e GCP. r=masterwayz, a=RyanVM\n\nThis is an \"uplift\" of the patches that have landed on central and made / are\nmaking their way down to release.\n\nBy pointing all aliases to GCP pools, I can avoid rebasing dozens of commits\nand dealing with the inevitable merge conflicts.\n\nDifferenti